!! Reference

```
User schema commands

Usage: mf schema <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check   Check metarecords against the schema and list the violations
  reload  Re-read the schema file
  show    Print the loaded schema (pretty-printed JSON)
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
